---
source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Save an HTTPS mailbox connection, inspect it, or switch this installation to local

Usage: mxr connect [OPTIONS] [URL]

Arguments:
  [URL]

Options:
      --allow-send       Request host-approved draft, attachment and send access; default pairing is read-only
      --allow-triage     Request host-approved mail organization, modes and todo access
      --allow-ai         Request host-approved AI mail features; host privacy policy still applies
      --cancel-pairing   Cancel only the pending pairing, preserving the selected registration
      --restart-pairing  Retire a pending pairing and request a fresh challenge at this URL
      --forget-cleanup   Forget the previewed cleanup intents locally; the old host may still have them registered
      --local
      --status
      --name <NAME>      [default: "mxr client"]
      --dry-run
      --confirm
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
